<title>JAPAN: BOJ's Matsushita attends parliament panel Thursday.</title>
<headline>BOJ's Matsushita attends parliament panel Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend an Upper House finance committee meeting on Thursday from 10 a.m. to 5.10 p.m. (0100 to 0810 GMT) to reply to questions from committee members, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
